From: X710 mainline port <bringup@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: link native X710 charge observation worker

One explicitly requested native observation, no automatic charging activation.
Reuse the existing default-disabled transaction profile without adding a symbol.

--- a/drivers/power/supply/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/Makefile
@@ -142,2 +142,3 @@
 obj-$(CONFIG_SM5440_ADC_TIMING_TEST) += sm5440-timing.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_SM5440_ADC_RAW_TEST) += sm5440-timing.o
+obj-$(CONFIG_X710_CHARGING_POLICY) += x710-charge-observer.o
